@ref s 83.222(2) (src:1706-1707)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 83.222(2) act`
`s 83.222(2) the duty to issue the summons` MEANS
    PARTY `a judge`
    MUST `s 83.222(2) issues a summons to the premises’ occupier requiring the occupier to appear before the court and to show cause why the matter seized should not be forfeited to Her Majesty`
    WITHIN 7
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `a judge` BECAUSE "the summons was not issued within seven days after the day on which the warrant was issued"

